# title: Live rendering preserves URL-valued labels and hides link destinations
# engines: cm
# timeout: 150
open:$V\url-label.md
uclick:实时@RadioButton
uclick:~Caret parking.
key:end
ms:1000
uia:link.url-label-visible|https://example.com
uia:link.plain-label-visible|PlainLabel
nouia:link.destination-hidden|https://target.invalid
nouia:link.other-destination-hidden|https://other.invalid
fileeq:link.source-unchanged|url-label.md|# Link labels\n\n[https://example.com](https://target.invalid)\n\n[PlainLabel](https://other.invalid)\n\nCaret parking.\n
shot:url-label
udump:url-label
